e PCR assays for testing of orthopoxviruses and Monkeypox virus –specific assays have varying Ct cutoffs depending on assay used.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Test results from duplicate swab from the initial lesion, inconclusive based on internal control indicating inadequate specimen collection.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Because of the discordant results, serum from patient A obtained on day 42 after rash onset was sent to CDC for serologic analysis\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"outcome_types\", \"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}